            assistance where it is needed.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="charity-list">
          <div class="charity-item">
            <h3>American Red Cross</h3>
            <p>Supporting emergency assistance and disaster relief.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="charity-item">
            <h3>Susan G. Komen Foundation</h3>
            <p>Supporting the fight against breast cancer.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="charity-item">
            <h3>Maine Lions Sight &amp; Hearing Foundation</h3>
            <p>Supporting vision and hearing services throughout Maine.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="charity-item">
            <h3>Fidelco Guide Dog Foundation</h3>
            <p>Supporting guide dog services and greater independence.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="charity-item">
            <h3>Blind Bowlers</h3>
            <p>Supporting opportunities and activities for people with visual impairments.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Local community -->
    <section class="service-section service-section-alt">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="service-section-heading">
          <span class="section-eyebrow">Right Here at Home</span>
          <h2>Helping Our Neighbors</h2>
          <p>
            Caring for our community means looking out for our neighbors,
            especially when they need a helping hand.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="service-card-grid">
          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">🍲</div>
            <h3>St. Anthony's Soup Kitchen</h3>
            <p>
              We provide food donations to St. Anthony's Soup Kitchen
              to help support its work feeding people in our community.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">🛒</div>
            <h3>Thanksgiving Food Assistance</h3>
            <p>
              We make donations to local food cupboards to help families
              in need during the Thanksgiving season.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">🎁</div>
            <h3>Christmas Gifts for Children</h3>
            <p>
              We help bring holiday happiness to local children by
              providing Christmas gifts to families who could use
              a little extra help.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="service-card">
            <div class="service-icon">🤝</div>
            <h3>Local Charitable Giving</h3>
            <p>
              We make donations to local charities and community
              organizations, helping them continue their important work.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Closing CTA -->
    <section class="service-cta">
      <div class="container">
